Consider the following multi-threaded code segment, invoked by two processes P1 and P2. Each process spawns three threads, and each thread executes bar(). Which of the following statement(s) is/are correct?

int c = 0;  // global
Lock M;     // global
main() {
  create three threads to execute bar();
  wait for the three threads to finish;
  print (c);
}

bar() {
  int t = 10;
  Acquire M;
  c = c + 2;
  t = t + 1;
  Release M;
  print (t);
}

